# What must never be packaged with the chart, even if it is left in its directory: keys, certificates, passphrase
# files, and what generate-mongodbsearch-prerequisites.sh (the main chart) writes.
*.secret.yaml
*.configmap.yaml
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
*.pass
.DS_Store
# Pictures: `helm install` stores the whole chart in the release's record and refuses a large one ("Request entity
# too large"). The README links its figure instead.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
